      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』に向けて、ソロで\r\nフェス形式のライブの仕事を受けただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこの主催者さんが、よかったらって言ってくださったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "終演後に撮影会とかをやるアーティストさんもいるし、\r\nルカもどうかって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030020,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "既存のファンの人たちに参加してもらうのはもちろん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他の人目当てでライブに来て、その日初めてルカを\r\n見てくれた人たちにも、アピールできる可能性がある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それに何より、ルカはファンを大事にしてるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030030,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ルカを応援してくれる人たちと関わるのは\r\nいい刺激にも、リフレッシュにもなるんじゃないかって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "思ったんだ──けど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030040,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あんまり気乗りしないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030050,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……は\r\nだったらどうだってんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030060,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "やりたくねェって言ったらやめんの？\r\nアンタ、そんな気持ちで仕事取ってきてんだ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうつもりじゃないんだ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030070,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "だったら黙ってやりゃァいいだろ\r\nいちいち顔色窺うな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030080,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……好きにさせる気もねぇくせに",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "っ、ルカ──！　嫌だと思うなら言ってくれ、\r\n何度も言うけど、ルカが望まないことは──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030090,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "なんでもいい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030100,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "──アンタの『それ』は、信用ならない",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "っ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003030110,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "──出てけよ\r\nそろそろ準備する",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600303/1026003030110"
  },
  {
